  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[preact](https://www.npmjs.com/package/preact) just published its new version 6.1.0.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Update :rocket:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      preact\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      6.1.0\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\nThis version is **not covered** by your **current version range**.\n\nWithout accepting this pull request your project will work just like it did before. There might be a bunch of new features, fixes and perf improvements that the maintainers worked on for you though.\n\nI recommend you look into these changes and try to get onto the latest version of preact.\nGiven that you have a decent test suite, a passing build is a strong indicator that you can take advantage of these changes by merging the proposed change into your project. Otherwise this branch is a great starting point for you to work on the update.\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n\nThe new version differs by 25 commits .\n- [`7ade275`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/7ade27579ffce259fa34be58ef48e6bbdd1919b4) <code>6.1.0</code>\n- [`e7c6ab6`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/e7c6ab672a5f18e67dec3cb7e7feabc7f404b337) <code>Move both className to class normalization and hashed class stringification out of `h()` and into the DOM renderer.</code>\n- [`d38660f`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/d38660f89b25c821de96e6352a077c6682ed81bf) <code>Move a few things around to save 2 bytes.</code>\n- [`f64d72a`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/f64d72acaccd4da83b57fed186f047b55fce68e5) <code>Found a way to knock 60 bytes off while improving performance of children flattening/normalization in `h()`!</code>\n- [`67cc02f`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/67cc02f4531ea71e8595c12c92c75c560d6c49f6) <code>Add support for single level of array children in h() (#313)</code>\n- [`c9a6eb7`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/c9a6eb7d66122f3b0e34ed34a1247fd9962c8e1a) <code>Add typings path to `package.json`. Fixes #318.</code>\n- [`73e3dfe`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/73e3dfe18823d51014e166c1db299a4677c19b75) <code>Temporarily turn off suspect assertion.</code>\n- [`0af7881`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/0af78814e5130719402bf0aef345c9a57739a26f) <code>Fix prop cache reset triggering in the wrong case (affected performance)</code>\n- [`76ba7f4`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/76ba7f4eb764a47e1ae21a266896779797d7ea0b) <code>Upon initial entry into diff, check if the diff should start out in SVG mode. Fixes #331.</code>\n- [`e0935e3`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/e0935e30f7adfc74333f41be14b00f394efffcfd) <code>Exclusively rely on DOM state when diffing `value` and `checked` props Fixes #326.</code>\n- [`22b6518`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/22b65182bc95a04dd2b281255094ba29757dc5f7) <code>When removing old props from the DOM, skip those with empty values.</code>\n- [`c7f8105`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/c7f8105e44b8cbd3d4a5760184bd4ca90da5d6bd) <code>[cruft removal]</code>\n- [`7f6a5be`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/7f6a5beaf5aff8db6c2c99c23efdfbdcbeb7302c) <code>Fix issue where re-rendering an intermediary high order component could remove (or fail to add) the associated element.</code>\n- [`ee7c20f`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/ee7c20f4637ee6aafef070fd6f966d74e5f778ef) <code>Merge branch 'master' of github.com:developit/preact</code>\n- [`2743a80`](https://github.com/developit/preact/commit/2743a807133b9f96702eb2a722e9f6ea7122fa57) <code>Address ownership issue when rendering using reclaimed DOM. Seems to be a fix for #297.</code>\n\nThere are 25 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/developit/preact/compare/d26ab44ac21a85650e22cf0dc3d8efc28997a569...7ade27579ffce259fa34be58ef48e6bbdd1919b4).\n\n---\n\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>\n",
